
---
import '@styles/styles.css';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="da">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Caritas | Oratorium</title>
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/assets/favicon-cross.svg">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@400;700&family=Inter:wght@300;400;600&family=Playfair+Display:ital@0;1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css">
    
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; background: #050202; color: #e5e7eb; }
        .sans { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }
        .serif-italic { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-style: italic; }
        
        .heart-beat {
            animation: heartbeat 3s infinite;
        }
        @keyframes heartbeat {
            0% { transform: scale(1); }
            5% { transform: scale(1.1); }
            10% { transform: scale(1); }
            15% { transform: scale(1.1); }
            20% { transform: scale(1); }
            100% { transform: scale(1); }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="selection:bg-red-500/30 min-h-screen flex flex-col pt-32">

    <!-- Nav -->
    <nav class="fixed top-8 left-8 z-50">
        <a href="/seek" class="text-red-500/60 hover:text-red-400 transition-colors text-xl flex items-center gap-2 sans bg-black/50 p-2 rounded backdrop-blur">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i>
            <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest hidden md:inline">Tilbage</span>
        </a>
    </nav>
    
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="text-center mb-16 px-4">
        <div class="w-20 h-20 mx-auto bg-red-900/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-red-500 text-3xl mb-6 border border-red-500/20 heart-beat">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-heart"></i>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl text-red-500 mb-6 font-serif drop-shadow-lg">Barmhjertighed</h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-[0.3em] sans max-w-lg mx-auto leading-loose">
            "Tro uden gerninger er død." — Jakobsbrevet 2,26
        </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Content Container -->
    <main class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 pb-32 space-y-24">
        
        <!-- INTRO -->
        <section class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center border-b border-white/5 pb-16">
            <p class="text-gray-300 sans text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
                Som kristne er vi kaldet til at være Kristi hænder og fødder på jorden. Det er ikke nok at vide det rigtige (Troslæren) eller bede det rigtige (Liturgien); vi må elske det rigtige (Caritas).
            </p>
            <p class="serif-italic text-red-400/80">
                Kirken opdeler barmhjertighedens gerninger i to: De Legemlige og De Åndelige.
            </p>
        </section>

        <!-- SECTION 1: CORPORAL WORKS -->
        <section>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-12 justify-center md:justify-start">
                <div class="h-px bg-red-500/30 flex-1 max-w-[50px]"></div>
                <h2 class="text-2xl text-red-100 font-serif">De 7 Legemlige Gerninger</h2>
                <div class="h-px bg-red-500/30 flex-1 max-w-[50px]"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
                
                <!-- 1. Feed Hungry -->
                <div class="bg-[#100a0a] border border-white/5 p-6 rounded hover:border-red-500/30 transition-all group">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-bread-slice text-red-500/50 text-2xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform block"></i>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-serif mb-2">Giv mad til de sultne</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 sans">Støt varmestuer, madindsamlinger eller del dit måltid.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- 2. Give Drink -->
                <div class="bg-[#100a0a] border border-white/5 p-6 rounded hover:border-red-500/30 transition-all group">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-glass-water text-red-500/50 text-2xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform block"></i>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-serif mb-2">Giv drikke til de tørstige</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 sans">Rent vand er en mangelvare mange steder. Værn om skaberværket.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- 3. Clothe Naked -->
                <div class="bg-[#100a0a] border border-white/5 p-6 rounded hover:border-red-500/30 transition-all group">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-shirt text-red-500/50 text-2xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform block"></i>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-serif mb-2">Klæd de nøgne</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 sans">Donér tøj du ikke bruger. Køb ansvarligt.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- 4. Shelter Homeless -->
                <div class="bg-[#100a0a] border border-white/5 p-6 rounded hover:border-red-500/30 transition-all group">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-house-chimney text-red-500/50 text-2xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform block"></i>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-serif mb-2">Giv husly til fremmede</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 sans">Gæstfrihed. Tag imod den, der står udenfor fællesskabet.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- 5. Visit Sick -->
                <div class="bg-[#100a0a] border border-white/5 p-6 rounded hover:border-red-500/30 transition-all group">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-bed-pulse text-red-500/50 text-2xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform block"></i>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-serif mb-2">Besøg de syge</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 sans">Tid er den største gave. Besøg ensomme på plejehjem eller hospital.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- 6. Visit Imprisoned -->
                <div class="bg-[#100a0a] border border-white/5 p-6 rounded hover:border-red-500/30 transition-all group">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-lock text-red-500/50 text-2xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform block"></i>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-serif mb-2">Besøg de fangne</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 sans">Også de, der er "fanget" af misbrug eller ensomhed.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- 7. Bury Dead -->
                <div class="bg-[#100a0a] border border-white/5 p-6 rounded hover:border-red-500/30 transition-all group col-span-1 md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-cross text-red-500/50 text-2xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform block"></i>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-serif mb-2">Begrav de døde</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 sans">Vis respekt for legemet, Helligåndens tempel. Bed for de afdøde og trøst de efterladte.</p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </section>


        <!-- SECTION 2: SPIRITUAL WORKS -->
        <section>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-12 justify-center md:justify-start">
                <div class="h-px bg-gold-500/30 flex-1 max-w-[50px]"></div>
                <h2 class="text-2xl text-gold-100 font-serif">De 7 Åndelige Gerninger</h2>
                <div class="h-px bg-gold-500/30 flex-1 max-w-[50px]"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
                
                <!-- 1. Instruct Ignorant -->
                <div class="bg-[#0a0a0c] border border-white/5 p-6 rounded hover:border-gold-500/30 transition-all group">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb text-gold-500/50 text-2xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform block"></i>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-serif mb-2">Undervise de uvidende</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 sans">Del sandheden med kærlighed. Hjælp andre med at forstå troen.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- 2. Counsel Doubtful -->
                <div class="bg-[#0a0a0c] border border-white/5 p-6 rounded hover:border-gold-500/30 transition-all group">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-comments text-gold-500/50 text-2xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform block"></i>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-serif mb-2">Råde de tvivlende</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 sans">Lyt tålmodigt og giv håb til dem, der har mistet modet.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- 3. Admonish Sinners -->
                <div class="bg-[#0a0a0c] border border-white/5 p-6 rounded hover:border-gold-500/30 transition-all group">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-gavel text-gold-500/50 text-2xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform block"></i>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-serif mb-2">Tilrettevise syndere</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 sans">Ikke fordømmelse, men broderlig korrektion. "Jeg ønsker ikke din død, men at du lever."</p>
                </div>

                <!-- 4. Bear Wrongs -->
                <div class="bg-[#0a0a0c] border border-white/5 p-6 rounded hover:border-gold-500/30 transition-all group">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-heart text-gold-500/50 text-2xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform block"></i>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-serif mb-2">Bære over med uret</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 sans">Tålmodighed, når andre er irriterende eller uretfærdige. Vær langmodig.</p>
                </div>

                 <!-- 5. Forgive Offenses -->
                 <div class="bg-[#0a0a0c] border border-white/5 p-6 rounded hover:border-gold-500/30 transition-all group">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-handshake text-gold-500/50 text-2xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform block"></i>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-serif mb-2">Tilgive fornærmelser</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 sans">At slippe vreden. "Forlad os vor skyld, som vi forlader vore skyldnere."</p>
                </div>
                
                 <!-- 6. Comfort Afflicted -->
                 <div class="bg-[#0a0a0c] border border-white/5 p-6 rounded hover:border-gold-500/30 transition-all group">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-hands-holding-circle text-gold-500/50 text-2xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform block"></i>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-serif mb-2">Trøste de bedrøvede</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 sans">Vær nærværende i andres smerte uden at prøve at "fikse" det med det samme.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- 7. Pray for Living/Dead -->
                <div class="bg-[#0a0a0c] border border-white/5 p-6 rounded hover:border-gold-500/30 transition-all group col-span-1 md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-praying-hands text-gold-500/50 text-2xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform block"></i>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-serif mb-2">Bede for levende og døde</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 sans">Den største gave. At bære andre frem for Guds trone, både venner og fjender.</p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- OUTRO -->
        <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center pt-16">
            <a href="https://www.caritas.dk" target="_blank" class="inline-block px-8 py-4 bg-red-900/20 text-red-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs rounded hover:bg-red-900/40 transition-colors border border-red-500/50 hover:scale-105 transform">
                Støt Caritas Danmark <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square ml-2"></i>
            </a>
            <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-600 mt-4 uppercase tracking-widest">
                Kirkens officielle hjælpeorganisation
            </p>
        </div>

    </main>

</body>
</html>
